<BlogLayout
  title="Why Every Building Project Starts With As-Built Drawings"
  description="As-built drawings are the foundation of a remodel, addition, or build-out. Here is why design, permits, pricing, and construction all depend on them."
  category="Guide"
  readTime="5 min"
  datePublished="2026-11-17"
  related={[
    { href: '/resources/what-are-as-built-drawings/', label: 'What Are As-Built Drawings? A Plain-English Guide' },
    { href: '/resources/as-built-drawings-vs-original-plans/', label: 'As-Built Drawings vs. Original Plans' },
    { href: '/quote/', label: 'Get an instant quote' },
